---
import { ArrowRight, BedDouble, Building2 } from 'lucide-astro';
---

<section id="solucoes" class="diagonal-stripes bg-dark py-20 text-white sm:py-28">
	<div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
		<div class="max-w-2xl">
			<p class="eyebrow brand-gradient-text reveal">Soluções prontas</p>
			<h2 class="reveal mt-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">
				Produtos RP7 para o seu segmento
			</h2>
			<p class="reveal mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/70">
				Além dos projetos sob medida, mantemos produtos próprios que já resolvem
				dores reais de operação — prontos para usar ou evoluir com você.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="mt-14 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2">
			<article class="reveal group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-8 backdrop-blur transition-colors hover:border-secondary/40 sm:p-10">
				<div
					class="brand-gradient absolute -right-20 -top-20 h-56 w-56 rotate-[-42deg] rounded-full opacity-10 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-20"
					aria-hidden="true"
				></div>
				<div class="relative">
					<div class="brand-gradient inline-flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl text-white shadow-lg shadow-primary/30">
						<BedDouble class="h-7 w-7" aria-hidden="true" />
					</div>
					<h3 class="mt-6 text-2xl font-bold">RP7 Hotelaria</h3>
					<p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-white/70">
						Sistema completo para hotéis, pousadas e hospedagens: reservas,
						mapa de ocupação, integração com OTAs, financeiro e painel para
						o hóspede.
					</p>
					<ul class="mt-5 space-y-2 text-sm text-white/60">
						<li>• Reservas e mapa de ocupação em tempo real</li>
						<li>• Integração com OTAs e channel manager</li>
						<li>• Financeiro e relatórios gerenciais</li>
					</ul>
					<a
						href="/solucoes/hotelaria"
						class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-secondary transition-colors hover:text-white"
					>
						Conhecer o RP7 Hotelaria
						<ArrowRight class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true" />
					</a>
				</div>
			</article>

			<article class="reveal group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-8 backdrop-blur transition-colors hover:border-secondary/40 sm:p-10">
				<div
					class="brand-gradient absolute -right-20 -top-20 h-56 w-56 rotate-[-42deg] rounded-full opacity-10 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-20"
					aria-hidden="true"
				></div>
				<div class="relative">
					<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
						<div class="brand-gradient inline-flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl text-white shadow-lg shadow-primary/30">
							<Building2 class="h-7 w-7" aria-hidden="true" />
						</div>
						<span class="rounded-full border border-secondary/40 bg-secondary/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary">
							Em breve
						</span>
					</div>
					<h3 class="mt-6 text-2xl font-bold">RP7 Imobiliárias</h3>
					<p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-white/70">
						Sistema web para imobiliárias: cadastro de imóveis, site integrado,
						CRM de leads, contratos e integração com portais.
					</p>
					<ul class="mt-5 space-y-2 text-sm text-white/60">
						<li>• Cadastro de imóveis e site integrado</li>
						<li>• CRM de leads e funil de atendimento</li>
						<li>• Publicação em portais imobiliários</li>
					</ul>
					<a
						href="/solucoes/imobiliarias"
						class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-secondary transition-colors hover:text-white"
					>
						Entrar na lista de espera
						<ArrowRight class="h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true" />
					</a>
				</div>
			</article>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
